hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15512","Abu Nuaym narrated to us: Misar narrated to us, from Amr ibn Dinar, he said: I heard Amr ibn Aws, he said: One who heard the caller of the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) informed me, when the prayer had been established, or when the time of prayer had come, or something like this: Pray in your dwellings, on account of rain that there was."
